~
13 0 0
0 0 0 0
1 0 0
E
blood stained sign~
To those brave enough to enter themselves into this fight club must know
several things...

Jian the brawler holds the only key that will let you escape from the fights.
Do not lose it, it is your only way out other than death.

No more than one fighter is allowed in at a time, finding ways around this can
and will result in bad things.

The mobs here are a challenge for a level 50, be prepared for the very worst.

Corez here will buy any pretty things the fighters inside may carry.

Good Luck.

-Nameless.
~
